{"channelId":"UCQ4GhHtZu2gzJG7jyawy16A","row":["For the Love of Kitten Rescue",698400,"✨It’s Good Mornings✨\n\nWelcome to @fortheloveofkittenrescue! My name is Mary (some call me Dr. Mary, PhD), and I am your host and creator of chaos. By day I am the President/Executive Director/Founder of Miss Dixie’s Kitten Rescue in South Carolina. By night I am usually asleep because I am in my thirties and we need our rest.\n\nThis channel (I hope) will take you on the journey of kitten rescue in the south. From vlogs to educational videos to just a silly goose time, I hope to bring awareness to the important work of animal rescue/welfare, teach you some things and laugh a little a long the way.\n\nEnjoy!\n\nDonate to Miss Dixie’s Kitten Rescue:\n\nhttps://www.classy.org/give/599787/#!/donation/checkout\n\nYou can follow me on other platforms here:\n\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@fortheloveofkittenrescue\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/fortheloveofkittenrescue\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/fortheloveofkittenrescue\nPatreon: https://www.patreon.com/Fortheloveofkittenrescue","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ4GhHtZu2gzJG7jyawy16A","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ4GhHtZu2gzJG7jyawy16A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:01:59.537Z","channelId":"UCQ4GhHtZu2gzJG7jyawy16A","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"da248da3a8f28d248cc10495008d61bf3ca4a9fb0b70c43c50da9bb278f6118e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"6a7ed20f3a0626f5bbf23f5e543f7183b215f4eeef46de46c3dd684b0ac42667"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ4GhHtZu2gzJG7jyawy16A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:18:36.264Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/fortheloveofkittenrescue","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":125869,"raw":"125,869","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.facebook.com/fortheloveofkittenrescue/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:33:03.424Z"}